351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 92 0 R
/T (An RNN processes input data step by step, and at each step, it combines the current input with information from the previous state. This enables the network to learn temporal dependencies and patterns over time. RNNs are commonly used in applications such as text processing, speech recognition, time-series prediction, and natural language processing.)
/E (An RNN processes input data step by step, and at each step, it combines the current input with information from the previous state. This enables the network to learn temporal dependencies and patterns over time. RNNs are commonly used in applications such as text processing, speech recognition, time-series prediction, and natural language processing.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
